42
00:08:09.689 --> 00:08:14.093
All these people
all going somewhere,
all doing something.

43
00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.562
But what does it all add up to?

44
00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:20.333
Maybe if I knew the answer,
