57
00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:48.327
Yeah, of course.

58
00:08:48.394 --> 00:08:53.399
There are a couple
of question marks
in your past.

59
00:08:53.833 --> 00:08:55.334
I recognize that.

60
00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:59.005
You're the first face
people see

61
