69
00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:22.361
They say you're smart.
He's a smart guy.

70
00:09:22.428 --> 00:09:24.297
Smart guy right here, huh?

71
00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:28.301
That's all good.
I guess I've got the job then.
When do I start?

72
00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:31.671
