193
00:16:28.687 --> 00:16:31.890
No. Don't fight.
Don't shoot.
It's cool.

194
00:16:31.957 --> 00:16:33.759
We're cool, man.
We're cool. All right?

195
00:16:33.826 --> 00:16:37.496
